<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<div type="attributeDocumentation" xml:id="attr-targetType" xmlns:eac="http://archivists.org/ns/eac/v2" xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xmlns:ead="https://archivists.org/ns/ead/v4">
               <head>
                  <att>targetType</att>
               </head>
               <div type="fullName">
                  <p>Target Type</p>
               </div>
               <div type="summary">
                  <p>Identifies the type of entity related to the entity or records being described.</p>
               </div>
               <div type="description">
                 <p>An optional attribute of <gi>relation</gi> that specifies the type of entity that is related to the entity or records being described.</p>
                 <p>Use the attribute <att>targetTypeEncoding</att> in <gi>control</gi> to identify the list of authoritative terms that can be used as values of <att>targetType</att>.</p>
               </div>
               <div type="datatype">
		              <p>token</p>
	             </div>
               <div type="examples">
                  <egXML xml:lang="eng"><![CDATA[<relation targetType="resource">
			  <label>Mémorial du colonel Gustafsson. - 1829</label>
		  </relation>]]></egXML>
                  <egXML xml:lang="eng"><![CDATA[<relation targetType="person" valueURI="https://d-nb.info/gnd/120636123" vocabularySource="GND" vocabularySourceURI="https://d-nb.info/gnd/">
			  <label>Sophie, Baden, Großherzogin, 1801-1865</label>
		  </relation>]]></egXML>
               </div>
            </div>
